        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Monitoring is a tool to evaluate the on-line effectiveness of employees to reach and maintain quality service. The approach for monitoring will continue to be based on a premise that fosters a work environment that builds on mutual trust and respect, which enhances job satisfaction.",
